00:07:46.164 --> 00:07:49.264
Oh, it's just that I thought I saw a girl
standing at the corner right there.

00:07:49.264 --> 00:07:50.464
What's your problem?!

00:07:50.464 --> 00:07:53.604
I can't believe you have the nerve to look
at another girl when you already have me!

00:07:53.604 --> 00:07:54.874
