00:08:13.284 --> 00:08:14.274
Yeah, exactly!

00:08:14.754 --> 00:08:15.554
Huh?!

00:08:15.554 --> 00:08:16.894
H-Hajime!

00:08:16.894 --> 00:08:17.924
Hi!

00:08:17.924 --> 00:08:19.084
