00:10:23.554 --> 00:10:27.754
Can it really be reset by that cyborg?

00:10:28.394 --> 00:10:31.124
The Demon King... The six sages...

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:32.524
Maika, why did you do that to me?

00:10:32.524 --> 00:10:34.794
That man is the Demon King...
Maika, why did you do that to me?

00:10:34.794 --> 00:10:35.334
That man is the Demon King...
Like I was saying...

00:10:35.334 --> 00:10:35.964
The legendary one who is believed to
have almost destroyed the world.
Like I was saying...

00:10:35.964 --> 00:10:38.454
The legendary one who is believed to
have almost destroyed the world.

