00:10:59.924 --> 00:11:00.654
Like I said!

00:11:00.654 --> 00:11:01.354
Explain yourself until I understand why!
Like I said!

00:11:01.354 --> 00:11:01.594
Explain yourself until I understand why!

00:11:01.594 --> 00:11:02.794
Explain yourself until I understand why!
It's very complicated!

00:11:02.794 --> 00:11:04.294
It's very complicated!

00:11:04.294 --> 00:11:07.124
Haruo! You've finally awakened!

00:11:07.124 --> 00:11:09.354
Now my curse will finally be lifted!

