I'll be waiting for you to come out at the exit!

00:14:44.614 --> 00:14:47.674
If there IS an exit, that is!

00:14:56.354 --> 00:14:59.584
Oh no! I'm so scared, Big Brother!

00:15:00.124 --> 00:15:02.794
Stop talking with that creepy voice!

00:15:03.334 --> 00:15:06.134
It sure is a freaky attraction...

00:15:07.534 --> 00:15:09.294
This is fun!

00:15:10.904 --> 00:15:14.064
At this rate, I'll never get alone with him.

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:17.574
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:15:20.284 --> 00:15:21.344
Huh?

00:15:21.754 --> 00:15:24.514
Now I'm in a huge room.

00:15:25.224 --> 00:15:26.344
Big Brother! Wai...

00:15:27.724 --> 00:15:29.054
Oww...

00:15:29.054 --> 00:15:31.794
You need to be more careful, Big Sis.

00:15:31.794 --> 00:15:32.894
Glass?

00:15:32.894 --> 00:15:34.794
You're one clumsy little girl, jeez!

00:15:35.964 --> 00:15:37.294
That's what happens when you don't pay attention.

00:15:38.534 --> 00:15:41.994
Look at you! Now you can't
talk about other people!

00:15:42.304 --> 00:15:43.034
Wait, something's wrong!

00:15:43.034 --> 00:15:44.074
I ACCIDENTALLY bumped into it!
Wait, something's wrong!

00:15:44.074 --> 00:15:44.904
I ACCIDENTALLY bumped into it!

00:15:45.104 --> 00:15:47.134
We've been trapped!

00:15:47.944 --> 00:15:49.204
What?!

00:15:54.214 --> 00:15:56.754
Watch out! Something's wrong!

00:15:56.754 --> 00:15:58.014
Big Brother!

00:15:58.454 --> 00:16:01.154
Huh? What? What's going on?

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:06.784
Thank you all for waiting!
Our special show will now begin!

00:16:06.964 --> 00:16:10.024
Oh, man... So that's what it was all about, huh?

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:14.894
Haruo!
Big Brother!

00:16:17.974 --> 00:16:21.274
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you all
for coming to Miracle House!

00:16:21.874 --> 00:16:25.344
What are you up to? Bring Haruo back now!

00:16:25.344 --> 00:16:27.814
That's not gonna happen, Big Sister!

00:16:28.484 --> 00:16:29.504
You!

00:16:33.424 --> 00:16:35.224
I knew it was you, Michiru!

00:16:35.224 --> 00:16:37.154
"Big Sister"?

00:16:37.154 --> 00:16:38.994
So she's your sister, Ayumi?

00:16:39.394 --> 00:16:43.294
Long time no see, Big Sister,
and the rest of you, too.

00:16:43.294 --> 00:16:47.204
It's been three months since we met last time,
but of course no one remembers me.

00:16:47.204 --> 00:16:49.674
And that man's power is responsible for it.

00:16:49.904 --> 00:16:51.394
What are you talking about?

00:16:52.974 --> 00:16:56.714
That man isn't only capable of lifting your curse.

00:16:56.714 --> 00:16:59.144
He possesses even more incredible power.

00:16:59.814 --> 00:17:02.114
That's why I'm going to make him mine!

00:17:02.354 --> 00:17:03.754
What did you just say?!

00:17:03.754 --> 00:17:05.754
Big Brother is MINE!

00:17:05.754 --> 00:17:07.324
No, he's MINE...

00:17:07.324 --> 00:17:09.624
Well, I guess this isn't the time for it...

00:17:09.624 --> 00:17:12.924
We're not going to give up Yoshikawa
to someone wicked like you!

00:17:12.924 --> 00:17:14.724
Give back our brother!
Give back our brother!

00:17:16.464 --> 00:17:20.504
I'm sorry to tell you this,
but you'll never see him again.

00:17:20.504 --> 00:17:21.834
Wanna know why?

00:17:21.834 --> 00:17:24.934
Because you are going to die RIGHT HERE!

00:17:33.314 --> 00:17:36.254
Well then, ladies, have a nice day!

00:17:38.424 --> 00:17:40.284
Michiru! Wait!

00:17:43.694 --> 00:17:44.494
Those are...

00:17:44.494 --> 00:17:46.324
Earth spirits, Golems!

00:17:46.694 --> 00:17:48.294
Battle Mode!

00:17:48.294 --> 00:17:49.764
Change Magical!

00:17:58.604 --> 00:18:01.234
They have no intention of giving
Yoshikawa back to us, huh?

00:18:11.624 --> 00:18:13.854
I have cut a worthless object...

00:18:13.854 --> 00:18:15.554
That's MY line!

00:18:19.894 --> 00:18:23.924
This is my New Year's special!

00:18:37.374 --> 00:18:38.434
And another one!

00:18:44.724 --> 00:18:47.384
Boy, I'm exhausted now.

00:18:49.154 --> 00:18:52.154
What the... There are more!

00:18:54.434 --> 00:18:55.594
Listen up, all of you!

00:18:55.594 --> 00:18:57.694
You have to give my brother back to us right now!

00:18:57.694 --> 00:19:00.304
If you do, we'll let it slide this time!

00:19:00.304 --> 00:19:03.704
I'm surprised... You've got some guts.

00:19:06.204 --> 00:19:09.574
HARUO!

00:19:10.474 --> 00:19:12.704
Yes? What can I do for you?

00:19:13.084 --> 00:19:15.844
Huh? Where am I?

00:19:17.414 --> 00:19:19.284
Huh? Who are you?

00:19:19.624 --> 00:19:21.624
I am Michiru Mamiya.

00:19:21.624 --> 00:19:23.294
What? Mamiya?

00:19:23.294 --> 00:19:26.784
That's right. I'm Ayumi Mamiya's younger sister.

00:19:27.024 --> 00:19:30.534
Oh, okay! Thank goodness!

00:19:30.534 --> 00:19:33.564
Actually, I got separated from
Mamiya and the others, and...

00:19:33.564 --> 00:19:36.334
If I remember correctly, I fell from up there and...

00:19:36.674 --> 00:19:38.974
Who cares about stuff like that?

00:19:38.974 --> 00:19:42.964
Because you'll never see my sister again.

00:19:43.214 --> 00:19:44.504
What?

00:19:44.784 --> 00:19:48.734
Because you are about to be mine!

00:20:03.264 --> 00:20:05.104
That'll show you!

00:20:05.104 --> 00:20:07.564
Don't you underestimate us!

00:20:11.944 --> 00:20:13.144
This isn't good!

00:20:13.144 --> 00:20:14.944
They're going to use magic!

00:20:28.424 --> 00:20:31.224
That... was a... good one...

00:20:55.014 --> 00:20:57.344
Someone please let me down!

00:20:58.384 --> 00:21:01.054
Thanks... You saved our lives...

00:21:01.054 --> 00:21:02.084
No problem.

00:21:03.354 --> 00:21:05.524
What happened to Yoshikawa?

00:21:05.524 --> 00:21:07.494
Where's my brother?

00:21:09.194 --> 00:21:10.194
Yoshikawa!
Big Brother!

00:21:10.194 --> 00:21:12.094
Michiru! What are you doing?

00:21:13.564 --> 00:21:17.274
I completely forgot that Rika was in this world.

00:21:17.274 --> 00:21:19.604
Michiru! Give Haruo back!

00:21:19.874 --> 00:21:22.844
No! The Demon King is MINE!

00:21:23.074 --> 00:21:24.544
The Demon King?!

00:21:25.614 --> 00:21:28.014
What? What is she talking about?!

00:21:28.014 --> 00:21:32.184
Wh-What? I don't know!
Even I don't understand what's going on!

00:21:32.184 --> 00:21:33.184
Big Bro is...

00:21:33.184 --> 00:21:34.254
The Demon King?!

00:21:34.254 --> 00:21:36.554
The Demon King?! Where is he?

00:21:36.554 --> 00:21:39.154
Stay right there! I'm coming to exterminate you!

00:21:45.204 --> 00:21:46.904
See ya, Big Sister.

00:21:46.904 --> 00:21:48.234
Michiru! Wait!

00:21:48.234 --> 00:21:49.404
Michiru!

00:21:49.404 --> 00:21:50.804
Yoshikawa!

00:21:50.804 --> 00:21:52.304
Big Brother!

00:21:52.304 --> 00:21:55.314
So she took him to the magical world, huh?

00:21:55.314 --> 00:21:56.864
How ignorant.

00:21:57.114 --> 00:21:58.804
No way...

00:21:59.914 --> 00:22:03.114
No way! No way!

00:22:03.114 --> 00:22:05.384
HARUO!

00:22:10.324 --> 00:22:13.314
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.834 --> 00:22:26.244
Naisho dakedo watashitte chigau no chotto

00:22:26.244 --> 00:22:32.444
Futsuu desu ka kawaiku mieru no Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.444 --> 00:22:38.984
Heiwa desu yo heibon dakedo ii jan? Li jan

00:22:38.984 --> 00:22:45.464
Sou omotte tara toraburu no tane ni konran

00:22:45.464 --> 00:22:51.764
Makenai watasanai wa taisetsu na anata

00:22:51.764 --> 00:22:58.294
Jumon wo tonaecha ikenai kamo ne

00:22:59.744 --> 00:23:06.144
Mahou no sei ja iya nanda mon

00:23:06.144 --> 00:23:12.684
Suki suki dake wa maji ga ii

00:23:12.684 --> 00:23:19.094
Anata wa dare ni koi shiteru

00:23:19.094 --> 00:23:25.264
Kotae wo minna matteru no

00:23:25.264 --> 00:23:28.574
Maji maji kore kara hajimaru
soudatsusen kara mamoranakucha

00:23:28.574 --> 00:23:30.034
Pinchi de panchi ga chirari rari

00:23:36.944 --> 00:23:38.604
The time for awakening is finally here!

00:23:39.084 --> 00:23:41.284
Haruo Yoshikawa, who has awakened
as the Demon King,

00:23:41.284 --> 00:23:43.044
is now trying to bring the world
into nothingness!

00:23:43.614 --> 00:23:46.084
Is everything a destined fate?

00:23:46.084 --> 00:23:47.954
Is there any way to stop it?

00:23:48.154 --> 00:23:50.884
The last hope is Ayumi and the others' wishes!

00:23:51.394 --> 00:23:54.694
The axis of repeated time now begins to melt...

00:23:56.134 --> 00:23:57.464
Next time on Magikano:

00:23:57.464 --> 00:23:59.024
"Magi? It's the Final Episode?"

00:24:00.264 --> 00:24:02.464
Fly towards tomorrow, Magikano!
